        <mxCell id="domainNote" value="Domain types (src/lib/&lt;family&gt;/domain/, src/lib/shared/domain/)&#xa;Issue · IssueEvent · IssueComment · TimeSeriesPoint · ErrorLevel · Log · LogLevel · VisitorsTimeSeriesPoint · Period&#xa;Pure TS, no Next / vendor dependency — importable from client and server. Feature view models (IssueRow, ErrorRatePoint, …) live in src/app/features/&lt;name&gt;/domain/." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
